From: ThinkSmart LineageOS 24 project (tsv-dev)
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: thinksmart: make mute button and privacy slider wakeup sources

Let the mic-mute button and camera privacy slider wake the system from
s2idle, so the vendor tsv-buttons daemon can turn them into a power key
(the LineageOS 15.1 behaviour).

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/apq8053-lenovo-cd-18781y.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/apq8053-lenovo-cd-18781y.dts
@@ -54,6 +54,7 @@
 			gpios = <&tlmm 87 GPIO_ACTIVE_LOW>;
 			linux,code = <SW_CAMERA_LENS_COVER>;
 			linux,input-type = <EV_SW>;
+			wakeup-source;
 		};
 
 		mic-mute-swtich {
@@ -61,6 +62,7 @@
 			gpios = <&tlmm 86 GPIO_ACTIVE_HIGH>;
 			linux,input-type = <EV_SW>;
 			linux,code = <SW_MUTE_DEVICE>;
+			wakeup-source;
 		};
 
 		volume-up-key {
